! Single segment in the UNAVERAGED mode, for the tier that compares the unaveraged
! dynamics directly against Genesis's averaged run from the same starting dumps -- a
! priced model-difference tier (ramps + no averaging + integrator structure), the
! unaveraged counterpart of tier2_bmad's priced seam. See aramis_1seg.bmad.
call, file = aramis_1seg.bmad
wiggler::*[TRACKING_METHOD] = fel_unaveraged
